{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a6e9abf9f2b18b66a3d18f7888eb972005db7cc9695e64c58c95480a09f6f5a7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的歌和羔羊的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看見天上又有一個宏大奇異的景象，有七位天使掌管著最後的七種災禍，上帝要藉這些災禍發盡祂的烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看見一個好像夾雜著火的玻璃海，玻璃海上站著那些戰勝怪獸、獸像及獸名代號的人。他們手裡拿著上帝所賜的豎琴，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["口裡唱著上帝的奴僕摩西的歌和羔羊的歌：",{"text":"「全能的主上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的作為偉大奇妙！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國的王啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的道路公義真實！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，誰敢不敬畏你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不歸榮耀給你的名呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為只有你是聖潔的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民都必到你面前敬拜你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你公義的作為已經彰顯出來了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["天使降七災"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["此後，我看見天上的聖殿，就是存放約櫃的聖幕打開了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那掌管七種災禍的七位天使都從殿中出來，身穿潔白發光的細麻布衣服，胸束金帶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["四個活物中的一個將七隻金碗分別交給七位天使，碗中盛滿了永活上帝的烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["殿裡彌漫著上帝的榮耀和權能散發的煙霧，人們必須等到七位天使將七樣災禍降完，才能進入聖殿。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}